'' A folded '2.5 ^ 2.5' equals the same pow at run time: the compiler's worker thread ran msvcrt's
'' x87 pow at 53-bit precision, one ulp off the program's (optimizations/consteval.bas).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/pow-fold-matches-runtime.bas -o tests/codegen/powfoldmatchesruntime.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/powfoldmatchesruntime.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1             -1            -1            -1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -1            -1            -1
